  "releaseNotes": "AstraFlow 1.4.0:\n      - Adds the AstraFlow.Contracts package for shared mediator contracts.\n      - Adds void requests, stream requests, stream pipeline behaviors, request pre/post processors, and request exception actions/handlers.\n      - Adds opt-in parallel and bounded-parallel notification publish strategies while keeping sequential publishing as the default.\n      - Adds mediator registration-builder helpers for explicit behavior and processor registration.\n      - Full changelog: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\n      - GitHub releases: https://github.com/seifmoustafa/AstraFlow/releases",
